- `RabbitDaisuke/typed-voice` (OmniVoice browser runtime): https://github.com/RabbitDaisuke/typed-voice
- `AnEntrypoint/omnivoice` (upstream model implementation): https://github.com/AnEntrypoint/omnivoice

