The split ONNX export implementation is adapted from `DaisukeDaisuke/tsukuyomichan-omnivoice-onnx` (MIT): https://github.com/DaisukeDaisuke/tsukuyomichan-omnivoice-onnx. Its license is compatible with the project MIT license.

The remaining original project files are provided under the MIT License in LICENSE.

ONNX Runtime Web and Hugging Face Tokenizers are bundled dependencies. Their license notices are listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

Model weights and Higgs Audio V2 tokenizer assets are separate works with separate license terms. Review the upstream model and tokenizer licenses before redistribution.

Reference audio/transcript assets are downloaded from Dezheen89/cosyvoice (Hugging Face model repository, Apache-2.0). They are included only as voice-cloning prompt samples and are not part of the OmniVoice model weights.
